  "methodology": {
    "text": "CAGenMol is a two-stage trained model using supervised fine-tuning followed by Step-PPO maximization of Eq. 11. The model is evaluated using Vina Dock, QED, and SA metrics. The training and inference protocol are detailed in the paper. The experimental setup involves using the CrossDocked2020 dataset, with 100,000 protein pocket–ligand complexes for training and 100 target protein pockets held out for evaluation.",
